th(cell_tuple, symprec=0.01) on the exact Atoms object written into CELL_PARAMETERS. Reproject point_coords from seekpath's reciprocal primitive lattice to the actual cell's reciprocal lattice via Cartesian coordinates (per INVARIANT 3). Build explicit k-point list with linear interpolation per segment, handling discontinuities (each segment contributes its own start point). Write as K_POINTS crystal card via kpts ndarray in write_espresso_in.\n\nBAND LABELS: band_labels.dat will contain each high-symmetry label and its index in the k-point list, for plotting."
